### TRANSFER
### ===========================
### 4. Create New Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfer/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "senderWalletId": 21,
  "receiverWalletId": 31,
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Pembayaran makan siang"
}



### Transfer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfer/
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "senderWalletId": 21,
  "receiverWalletId": 31,
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Transfer to Budi"
}

### Transfer - Insufficient Balance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderUserId": 1,
  "receiverUserId": 2,
  "amount": 999999999,
  "description": "Insufficient balance test"
}

### Transfer - Invalid Amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderUserId": 1,
  "receiverUserId": 2,
  "amount": -10000,
  "description": "Invalid amount test"
}

