### Get Transaction History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history
Accept: application/json

### Search by Reference Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?search=TRX
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?type=TRANSFER
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?status=SUCCESS
Accept: application/json

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Sorting by Amount
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?sortBy=amount&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transaction/history?startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-18
Accept: application/json




